<title>LITHUANIA: MEDIENOS PLAUSHAS 7 MO 97 NET PROFIT UP.</title>
<headline>MEDIENOS PLAUSHAS 7 MO 97 NET PROFIT UP.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first half of 1997</p>
<p>					( amounts in million litas)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  2.1  vs  1.4</p>
<p>    Sales				25.1  vs 23.5</p>
<p>Note: The corrugated cardboard producer Medienos Plaushas, one of the three corporates on the five member</p>
<p>official list of the Vilnius bourse posted 1.8 mln litas net</p>
<p>profit and 22.35 million litas sales in the first half of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17. 15</p>
